"Runs wp core install via WP-CLI to create all WordPress tables, set the site"
" URL, title, and admin account."
msgstr ""
"Führt wp core install über WP-CLI aus, um alle WordPress-Tabellen zu "
"erstellen und Site-URL, Titel und Administratorkonto festzulegen."

